{"seq":1,"slug":"reship-shipping-fault-attribution","title":"补发运费责任归属（平台/卖家/买家）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/exchange-reship-fulfillment/reship-cost-customs/reship-shipping-fault-attribution","wordCount":1885,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"补发运费责任归属-平台-卖家-买家\">补发运费责任归属（平台/卖家/买家）</h1><p>补发一次产生的运费，可能落在三个不同的主体上：平台补贴、卖家自担、买家承担。争议最集中的是第三种——买家往往认为「东西没收到，凭什么让我出运费」，而卖家认为「货已经发出了，是承运人弄丢的，凭什么让我再出一次」。这一篇给出把这种争议转化为可计算规则的结构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-责任判定必须先于费用计算\">核心概念：责任判定必须先于费用计算</h2><p>费用归属的第一原则是：<strong>它由事实判定结果驱动，而不是由工单金额或客服裁量驱动</strong>。理由是可申诉性——如果一笔费用是客服凭感觉分摊的，那么当卖家要求平台承担时，平台无法解释为什么同类案件有不同的结果；当卖家向承运人索赔时，也无法提供一致的责任依据。</p>\n<p>事实判定（第 2 章第 1 篇）产出五种归因：卖家责任、承运人责任、共担、未成立、未判定。费用归属直接引用这个结果：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>事实类型</th>\n<th>归因</th>\n<th>补发运费承担方</th>\n<th>二次进口税费承担方</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>漏发 MISSING_FULL</td>\n<td>卖家责任</td>\n<td>卖家</td>\n<td>卖家（且通常可主张替换待遇）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>少件 MISSING_PART</td>\n<td>卖家责任</td>\n<td>卖家</td>\n<td>卖家</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错发 WRONG_ITEM</td>\n<td>卖家责任</td>\n<td>卖家</td>\n<td>卖家（错发件可能无需退回）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>破损 DAMAGED</td>\n<td>承运人责任（有货损记录）或卖家</td>\n<td>卖家先垫付，向承运人索赔</td>\n<td>按承运人赔付情况</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>丢失 LOST_IN_TRANSIT</td>\n<td>承运人责任</td>\n<td>卖家先垫付，向承运人索赔</td>\n<td>按承运人赔付情况</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>买家改主意（非质量原因）</td>\n<td>无归因</td>\n<td>买家</td>\n<td>买家</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表最重要的结构特征是**「卖家先垫付、再向承运人索赔」这一列被重复了两次**。它表达了一个关键工程结论：即使归因结果指向承运人，对买家的处置也不能等待索赔结果。理由既有法律依据也有商业逻辑：欧盟《消费者权益指令》第 20(3) 条规定消费者未收到货物时风险回到经营者一侧，因此运输中丢失不是买家需要承担的风险（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/HTML/?uri=CELEX:32011L0083\">Directive 2011/83/EU</a>）。把买家放在索赔链条里等待，等于把自己的商业风险转嫁给消费者。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[补发产生费用] --&gt; B[读取事实归因]&#10;  B --&gt;|卖家责任| C[卖家承担&lt;br/&gt;计入售后成本]&#10;  B --&gt;|承运人责任| D[卖家先垫付]&#10;  B --&gt;|共担| E[按比例分摊]&#10;  B --&gt;|无归因| F[买家承担&lt;br/&gt;事先告知]&#10;  D --&gt; G[向承运人提出索赔]&#10;  G --&gt; H{索赔结果}&#10;  H --&gt;|赔付| I[冲减售后成本]&#10;  H --&gt;|拒赔/超时| J[全额计入售后成本]&#10;  E --&gt; C\">graph TD\n  A[补发产生费用] --&gt; B[读取事实归因]\n  B --&gt;|卖家责任| C[卖家承担&lt;br/&gt;计入售后成本]\n  B --&gt;|承运人责任| D[卖家先垫付]\n  B --&gt;|共担| E[按比例分摊]\n  B --&gt;|无归因| F[买家承担&lt;br/&gt;事先告知]\n  D --&gt; G[向承运人提出索赔]\n  G --&gt; H{索赔结果}\n  H --&gt;|赔付| I[冲减售后成本]\n  H --&gt;|拒赔/超时| J[全额计入售后成本]\n  E --&gt; C</pre><h2 id=\"承运人赔付的额度天花板\">承运人赔付的额度天花板</h2><p>理解「卖家先垫付再索赔」为什么不等于「风险转移给承运人」，需要看承运人赔付的额度。运输公约的赔偿限额普遍<strong>按重量而非按价值</strong>计算，这使得高价值轻小件的赔付远低于货值。</p>\n<p>以航空运输为例，《蒙特利尔公约》下承运人对行李损失或损坏的赔偿责任上限为 1,519 特别提款权（SDR），对旅客伤亡的严格责任上限为 128,821 SDR（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Montreal_Convention\">Montreal Convention</a>）。这里的 SDR 是国际货币基金组织的一篮子货币计价单位，其数值会定期调整，因此<strong>不要把 SDR 硬编码成某个美元金额</strong>，而应作为可配置的换算率读取。</p>\n<p>这个结构的工程含义是：索赔是一条<strong>部分回收</strong>路径，其回收率与商品的价值密度强相关。一台 3 公斤的咖啡机（低价值密度）索赔回收率可能很高；一部 200 克的手机（高价值密度）索赔回收率可能只有几个百分点。因此系统在计算补发净成本时，应使用一个与品类相关的回收率假设，而不是一个全局常数。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>商品特征</th>\n<th>货值</th>\n<th>计费重量</th>\n<th>索赔上限（重量制）</th>\n<th>回收率量级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>重货低值</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高（可能全覆盖）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>轻小高值</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低（个位数百分比）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>回收率不是精确预测，但它的作用是让成本台账区分「已尽力回收」与「从未索赔」。这两者的管理含义完全不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"费用对象的数据模型\">费用对象的数据模型</h2><p>费用必须建成独立对象，一条费用一行，带上它的责任方、计算依据与最终结算状态。把费用写成补发单上的几个字段（<code>shipping_cost</code>、<code>duty_cost</code>）会立刻遇到三个问题：无法表达分摊、无法记录索赔回收、无法回答「这笔钱最后谁付了」。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE reship_cost (&#10;  cost_id        BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  request_id     BIGINT      NOT NULL REFERENCES reship_request(request_id),&#10;  cost_type      TEXT        NOT NULL&#10;                 CHECK (cost_type IN (&#39;FORWARD_FREIGHT&#39;,&#39;DUTY&#39;,&#39;TAX&#39;,&#10;                                      &#39;PACKAGING&#39;,&#39;GOODS_LOSS&#39;,&#39;RETURN_FREIGHT&#39;)),&#10;  amount_minor   BIGINT      NOT NULL CHECK (amount_minor &gt; 0),&#10;  currency       CHAR(3)     NOT NULL,&#10;&#10;  bearer         TEXT        NOT NULL&#10;                 CHECK (bearer IN (&#39;SELLER&#39;,&#39;PLATFORM&#39;,&#39;BUYER&#39;,&#39;CARRIER&#39;)),&#10;  bearer_share   NUMERIC(5,4) NOT NULL DEFAULT 1.0&#10;                 CHECK (bearer_share &gt; 0 AND bearer_share &lt;= 1),&#10;  attribution    TEXT        NOT NULL&#10;                 CHECK (attribution IN (&#39;SELLER_FAULT&#39;,&#39;CARRIER_FAULT&#39;,&#10;                                        &#39;SHARED&#39;,&#39;NO_FAULT&#39;,&#39;UNDETERMINED&#39;)),&#10;&#10;  recovery_state TEXT        NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;NA&#39;&#10;                 CHECK (recovery_state IN&#10;                   (&#39;NA&#39;,&#39;CLAIM_OPEN&#39;,&#39;CLAIM_PAID&#39;,&#39;CLAIM_REJECTED&#39;,&#39;ABANDONED&#39;)),&#10;  recovered_minor BIGINT     NOT NULL DEFAULT 0 CHECK (recovered_minor &gt;= 0),&#10;&#10;  incurred_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  CONSTRAINT recovery_consistent CHECK (&#10;    (recovery_state IN (&#39;CLAIM_PAID&#39;) AND recovered_minor &gt; 0)&#10;    OR (recovery_state NOT IN (&#39;CLAIM_PAID&#39;) AND recovered_minor = 0)&#10;  )&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reship_cost</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cost_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  request_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reship_request(request_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cost_type      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                 CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (cost_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'FORWARD_FREIGHT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DUTY'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'TAX'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                                      'PACKAGING'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'GOODS_LOSS'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'RETURN_FREIGHT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  amount_minor   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (amount_minor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  bearer         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                 CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (bearer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SELLER'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PLATFORM'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'BUYER'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CARRIER'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  bearer_share   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                 CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (bearer_share </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bearer_share </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  attribution    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                 CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (attribution </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SELLER_FAULT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CARRIER_FAULT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                                        'SHARED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'NO_FAULT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'UNDETERMINED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  recovery_state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'NA'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                 CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (recovery_state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                   (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'NA'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CLAIM_OPEN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CLAIM_PAID'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CLAIM_REJECTED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ABANDONED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  recovered_minor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (recovered_minor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  incurred_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recovery_consistent </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (recovery_state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CLAIM_PAID'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recovered_minor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    OR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (recovery_state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CLAIM_PAID'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recovered_minor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两个约束设计点。<code>bearer_share</code> 让分摊成为一等公民——共担场景下同一笔费用可以由多行表达（比如卖家 70% + 平台 30%），而不是塞进一个字段的字符串。<code>recovery_consistent</code> 保证回收金额只在索赔实际到账时才非零，避免「预计回收」被当成「已经回收」，这是售后成本台账最常见的失真来源。</p>\n<p>按责任方聚合的成本，就是把这张表按 <code>attribution</code> 与 <code>bearer</code> 分组：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT attribution,&#10;       bearer,&#10;       count(*)                          AS cost_lines,&#10;       sum(amount_minor) / 100.0         AS incurred,&#10;       sum(recovered_minor) / 100.0      AS recovered,&#10;       sum(amount_minor - recovered_minor) / 100.0 AS net&#10;FROM   reship_cost&#10;WHERE  incurred_at &gt;= :period_start AND incurred_at &lt; :period_end&#10;GROUP  BY GROUPING SETS ((attribution, bearer), (attribution), ())&#10;ORDER  BY attribution NULLS LAST, bearer NULLS LAST;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> attribution,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       bearer,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cost_lines,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount_minor) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> incurred,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(recovered_minor) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recovered,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount_minor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recovered_minor) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> net</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   reship_cost</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  incurred_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :period_start </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> incurred_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :period_end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP  BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GROUPING </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SETS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ((attribution, bearer), (attribution), ())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER  BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> attribution </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NULLS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LAST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, bearer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NULLS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LAST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个查询用 <code>GROUPING SETS</code> 一次给出明细与两级汇总，避免写三个查询再在应用层合并。它是第 4 章度量台账的数据基础，见 <a href=\"../reship-fraud-recovery/reship-cost-sla-service-metric\">补发成本/SLA/一次解决率度量</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"向买家收费为什么最难\">向买家收费为什么最难</h2><p>四种承担方里，向买家收费是唯一需要<strong>事前同意</strong>的。原因是它必须在买家下单或确认补发时被明确告知并接受，否则事后扣款会直接变成支付争议。</p>\n<p>这里有一个具体的机制约束：卡组织争议里「商品未收到」是独立的一类争议原因代码（Visa 的 13.1 Merchandise/Services Not Received），退款类与重复付款类是另外的代码组（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/disputes/categories\">Stripe 争议原因类别</a>）。这意味着如果一笔补发运费被未经同意地扣除，买家的投诉路径是走「商品未收到」这一类，而卖家在这类争议中的抗辩材料是交付证据——一笔运费扣款无法用交付证据解释清楚，因此几乎必然败诉，且败诉会推高争议率，进而可能触发卡组织的监控计划。</p>\n<p>因此「买家承担」只在两种情形下可用：买家改主意这类无归因场景，且事先已明确告知；或者买家主动选择了加速通道（本地仓直发）而该通道有明确报价。除此之外，正确做法是把费用吸收到卖方或平台，而不是试图向买家追收。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>费用归属必须由<strong>事实判定结果驱动</strong>，不能由工单金额或客服裁量驱动，否则无法申诉也无法申诉一致性。</li>\n<li>归因指向承运人时仍是<strong>卖家先垫付、再索赔</strong>：交付前风险在商家一侧，把买家放进索赔链条既有法律问题也有体验问题。</li>\n<li>承运人赔付上限<strong>按重量计算</strong>，高价值轻小件的回收率很低；回收率应与品类相关，而不是全局常数。</li>\n<li>费用建成<strong>独立对象</strong>（一行一费用），用 <code>bearer_share</code> 表达分摊、用 <code>recovery_state</code> 区分「预计回收」与「实际到账」。</li>\n<li>向买家收费<strong>必须有事前同意</strong>，否则会转化为「商品未收到」类支付争议，而这类争议无法用交付证据之外的材料抗辩。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"与其他篇的边界\">与其他篇的边界</h2><p>本篇只讲运费与税费的责任归属与台账结构。事实如何归因见 <a href=\"../reship-decision-scenario/missing-short-wrong-damaged-lost\">漏发/少件/错发/破损/丢失判定</a>；报关申报如何影响税费金额见 <a href=\"reship-customs-invoice-treatment\">补发件跨境清关与发票处理</a>；交付证据如何组织见 <a href=\"reship-intransit-proof-delivery\">补发在途追踪与签收证明</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"补发运费责任归属（平台/卖家/买家）","id":"补发运费责任归属-平台-卖家-买家"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：责任判定必须先于费用计算","id":"核心概念-责任判定必须先于费用计算"},{"level":2,"text":"承运人赔付的额度天花板","id":"承运人赔付的额度天花板"},{"level":2,"text":"费用对象的数据模型","id":"费用对象的数据模型"},{"level":2,"text":"向买家收费为什么最难","id":"向买家收费为什么最难"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"与其他篇的边界","id":"与其他篇的边界"}],"prev":{"title":"本地仓直发/随箱补发快速通道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/exchange-reship-fulfillment/reship-decision-scenario/reship-local-warehouse-fastpath"},"next":{"title":"补发件跨境清关与发票处理（联157/188）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/exchange-reship-fulfillment/reship-cost-customs/reship-customs-invoice-treatment"}}